  "rhythm": "Twitch owner credit: Acry. Songsterr s214 revision 9338803 at its source tempo of 186 BPM, global beats 0-62: exactly the recording's first 20 seconds, ending at bar 16 beat 3. The ocarina carries Billie Joe Armstrong's power-chord roots through bars 1-8, switches to the lead-vocal track for bars 9-10, returns to the two-bar guitar answer, carries the next vocal phrase in bars 13-14, then resumes the riff through the cutoff. The two notated half-beat vocal pickups remain rests; all pitches are octave-folded only, with no key change. Backing uses the matching lead/rhythm/overdub guitars, Mike Dirnt bass, and Tre Cool drums from the same bars. Because the OoT soundfont has no electric-guitar program, its supported church organ, fiddle, and trombone samples represent the three source guitar roles.",
